#: ../../source/api/cli/cheatsheet.md:1 6114d7a7be974581ad8a540d60520012
msgid "命令行速查表"
msgstr "Command Line Cheatsheet"

#: ../../source/api/cli/cheatsheet.md:3 09d43215590648098bff2db55d82eaa2
msgid ""
"UniKT 基于 [jsonargparse](https://jsonargparse.readthedocs.io/) "
"构建了类型安全、分层解耦的命令行解析系统。所有 CLI 参数直接映射到强类型的 Dataclass（`RunConfig` "
"树），具备自动类型转换、合法性校验与层次化命名空间。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT builds a type-safe, hierarchically decoupled command line parsing "
"system based on [jsonargparse](https://jsonargparse.readthedocs.io/). All"
" CLI parameters map directly to strongly typed dataclasses (`RunConfig` "
"tree), featuring automatic type casting, validity checks, and "
"hierarchical namespaces."

