msgstr "2\\. View All Parameters of a Specific Model"

#: ../../source/api/cli/cheatsheet.md:101 ce05d9e932154c2b94221afcdf81e542
msgid ""
"当你指定了 `-m <模型名>` 后，jsonargparse 会自动解析该模型的专用 `ModelConfig` 类并将其参数动态挂载在 "
"`--model.*` 命名空间下："
msgstr ""
"When you specify `-m <ModelName>`, jsonargparse automatically inspects "
"the model's dedicated `ModelConfig` class and mounts its parameters "
"dynamically under the `--model.*` namespace:"

#: ../../source/api/cli/cheatsheet.md:103 c264f013b59a4f9c88dab6ef91d3b470
msgid ""
"# 查看包含 GIKT 特定超参数的完整帮助文档\n"
"python train.py -m GIKT -h\n"
"\n"
"# 查看包含 Mamba4KT 专用参数的完整帮助\n"
"python train.py -m Mamba4KT -h\n"
msgstr ""
"# View full help documentation including GIKT-specific hyperparameters\n"
"python train.py -m GIKT -h\n"
"\n"
"# View full help including Mamba4KT-specific parameters\n"
"python train.py -m Mamba4KT -h\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/cheatsheet.md:111 900ccaa188f44d15a8a9d092ce1fd77e
